WEBVTT

00:10:58.480 --> 00:11:00.136
Of course, that's not possible.

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:02.736
I wish it was. I would have my son back.

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:05.040
My brother would have his grandson back.

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:09.880
So I think that demonstrates
the power of forgiveness.

00:11:11.640 --> 00:11:13.720
So what's the big takeaway here?

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:18.136
So I want to end
our session with this quote,

00:11:18.160 --> 00:11:20.856
which is the basis of my fourth book,

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:22.736
which incidentally,

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:25.200
the foreword for that book
was written by Tony.

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:30.736
So it goes like this:
sustained goodwill creates friendship.